">https://www.threads.com/t/DeZtp7KER52</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:56:28 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>birchlane</dc:creator></item><item><title>@birchlane: Muse Wonder is also available through Muse Code, the Meta Model API, and rolling into other products soon. More in the blog: https://research.m...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@birchlane&lt;/strong&gt; ↩️:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muse Wonder is also available through Muse Code, the Meta Model API, and rolling into other products soon. More in the blog: https://research.meta.ai/blog/muse-wonder&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.threads.com/t/DeZtp8hkWfQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.threads.com/t/DeZtp8hkWfQ</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:56:28 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>birchlane</dc:creator></item><item><title>@birchlane: Muse ordered me 🍉 how thoughtful!</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@birchlane&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muse ordered me 🍉 how thoughtful!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://scontent-arn2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/843592055_17991691623103224_8086321653765802754_n.webp?_nc_cat=102&amp;amp;ig_cache_key=NDAwNjM3NjE2MDMzOTE0MTcxOA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&amp;amp;ccb=7-5&amp;amp;_nc_sid=58cdad&amp;amp;efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkZFRUQueHBpZHMuMTUwMC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=CmgthCChTzwQ7kNvwGFTyyE&amp;amp;_nc_oc=AdrLMoVdsSwLz3a1plqhBspeYvRiA1TwHUxv_J4nKQl5LFoGKH60cChwlCtjYPLInu4f9Oo6Mj4tko1XIiju42O0&amp;amp;_nc_ad=z-m&amp;amp;_nc_cid=0&amp;amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent-arn2-1.cdninstagram.com&amp;amp;_nc_gid=chO5pE3rlW8C5KtRwfxzWw&amp;amp;_nc_ss=7a20f&amp;amp;oh=00_AQMau72R3ra_fbjyDH0QlfI15OZgciYmyxv0sduexVXcew&amp;amp;oe=6ADD8FE8&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.threads.com/t/DeZgeQhm6RW</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.threads.com/t/DeZgeQhm6RW</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:01:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>birchlane</dc:creator></item><item><title>@birchlane: CJ joins us from MongoDB, where he was CEO and President. Before that he led product and engineering at Cloudflare and spent nearly eight years...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@birchlane&lt;/strong&gt; ↩️:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CJ joins us from MongoDB, where he was CEO and President. Before that he led product and engineering at Cloudflare and spent nearly eight years at ServiceNow, including as President and COO.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1MriSm3-u</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1MriSm3-u</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:35:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>birchlane</dc:creator></item><item><title>@birchlane: We believe superintelligence will create significant new opportunities for all people and businesses. Meta already serves billions of people at...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@birchlane&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe superintelligence will create significant new opportunities for all people and businesses. Meta already serves billions of people at scale and helps hundreds of millions of businesses reach customers. Today we are starting the next major pillar of our business, Meta Enterprise Platform, to help businesses use AI to grow and transform in new ways as well.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1MqfcG0aH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1MqfcG0aH</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:35:32 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>birchlane</dc:creator></item><item><title>@birchlane: Meta Enterprise Platform will use our strengths that few other companies have: advanced models, leading agents, large-scale infrastructure, and...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@birchlane&lt;/strong&gt; ↩️:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meta Enterprise Platform will use our strengths that few other companies have: advanced models, leading agents, large-scale infrastructure, and years of working closely with many businesses. Initially, we will focus on bringing our full technology stack, including the Muse agent, Meta Business Agent, Muse API, Muse Code, and more to businesses and developers to help them grow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1Mqfum3QF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1Mqfum3QF</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:35:32 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>birchlane</dc:creator></item><item><title>@birchlane: To lead this effort, I&#39;m excited that Chirantan &quot;CJ&quot; Desai will join Meta as Chief Enterprise Platform Officer, reporting directly to me. CJ is...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@birchlane&lt;/strong&gt; ↩️:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To lead this effort, I&#39;m excited that Chirantan &quot;CJ&quot; Desai will join Meta as Chief Enterprise Platform Officer, reporting directly to me. CJ is an experienced enterprise leader with a track record of building full-stack software and delivering results in AI, infrastructure, business applications, and security. He has an extensive industry network that we look forward to partnering with.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1MqeVG3vT</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.threads.com/t/Dd1MqeVG3vT</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:35:32 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>birchlane</dc:creator></item><item><title>@birchlane: Agrippa said it&#39;s time to get back to work 😎</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;@birchlane&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agrippa said it&#39;s time to get back to work 😎&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://scontent-arn2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/823965183_17989304049103224_2823186847710225415_n.webp?_nc_cat=110&amp;amp;ig_cache_key=Mzk5NDA5NjMwNTI0NDIwMTIwNQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&amp;amp;ccb=7-5&amp;amp;_nc_sid=58cdad&amp;amp;efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMjE2MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&amp;amp;_